  "given_answer": "（1）30﹣\\(\\sqrt[] { 2 }\\)；（2）1﹣2\\(\\sqrt[] { 6 }\\)；（3）x\\({}_{1}\\)＝\\(\\frac { 8 } { 3 }\\)，x\\({}_{2}\\)＝﹣\\(\\frac { 4 } { 3 }\\)；（4）x＝\\(\\frac { 1 } { 2 }\\)．",
